<mxCell id="t8_active_closed" value="cancel_performance_improvement_plan()" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s_active" target="s_closed"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;Side effects&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Creation: linked attention records → actioned, manual concerns → consumed; pending reports may be bypassed (rejected with PIP_BYPASS).&lt;br&gt;• DECISION_PENDING suspends ordinary reporting obligations.&lt;br&gt;• Close/cancel deactivates PIP-owned KPI configurations and queues reconcile_performance_after_pip_resolution.&lt;br&gt;• Cancel: attention records → dismissed, concerns → active." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa900;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="820" width="560" height="170" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note2" value="PIP also carries approval_status (BaseApprovableModel). Whether scheduled PIPs can be cancelled the same way as active ones is implied by the service but should be verified." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa900;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="820" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
